# --- EnergyPlus simulation assets (fetched, not committed: size + licensing) ---
simulation/baseline.idf
simulation/weather.epw
simulation/agentic.idf
simulation/agentic_model.json
*.epw

# Generated model series (competition deliverable #2). Produced per machine by running the
# harness, and packaged at submission time - committing every prototype-sized IDF the agent
# emits would bloat the repo for no reviewable benefit. `manifest.json` describes the series.
# (Ignore the *contents*, not the directory: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so a negation inside one never matches.)
simulation/versions/*
!simulation/versions/.gitkeep

